{"id":"6d19484c6bfee7df","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-embedding.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Complete Embedding","display":"df-zfc-forcing-complete-embedding — ZFC Forcing Complete Embedding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-embedding","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-embedding","58-df-zfc-forcing11-complete-embedding","58-df-zfc-forcing4-complete-embedding","58-df-zfc-forcing8-complete-embedding"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-complete-embedding — ZFC Forcing Complete Embedding","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-maximal-antichain]]","[[58-df-poset]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-embedding</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing11-complete-embedding</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing4-complete-embedding</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing8-complete-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-complete-embedding — ZFC Forcing Complete Embedding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb7c32a0f0383968\" href=\"?note=fb7c32a0f0383968\" title=\"58-df-maximal-antichain\">58-df-maximal-antichain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\\in V\">\\(P,Q\\in V\\)</span> with orders <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\">\\(\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\\)</span> (forcing posets; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in V\">\\(e\\in V\\)</span> (embedding graph candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq P\">\\(A\\subseteq P\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in P\">\\(p,q\\in P\\)</span> (variables bound in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S\\)</span> (partial-order and maximal-antichain predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11CompleteEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11CompleteEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4CompleteEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4CompleteEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CompleteEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CompleteEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}complete\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteEmbedding}_S(e,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,P,Q)\\land\\forall p,q\\in P\\;(e(p)=e(q)\\to p=q)\\land\\forall p,q\\in P\\;(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\leftrightarrow\\langle e(p),e(q)\\rangle\\in\\leq_Q)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\\to\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(e``A,Q,\\leq_Q))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}complete\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteEmbedding}_S(e,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,P,Q)\\land\\forall p,q\\in P\\;(e(p)=e(q)\\to p=q)\\land\\forall p,q\\in P\\;(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\leftrightarrow\\langle e(p),e(q)\\rangle\\in\\leq_Q)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\\to\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(e``A,Q,\\leq_Q))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}complete\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11CompleteEmbedding}_S(e,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteEmbedding}_S(e,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}complete\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11CompleteEmbedding}_S(e,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteEmbedding}_S(e,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}complete\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing4CompleteEmbedding}_S(P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q,e)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteEmbedding}_S(e,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}complete\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing4CompleteEmbedding}_S(P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q,e)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteEmbedding}_S(e,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}complete\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CompleteEmbedding}_S(e,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteEmbedding}_S(e,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}complete\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CompleteEmbedding}_S(e,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteEmbedding}_S(e,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A complete embedding is an injective order embedding that carries maximal antichains of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> to maximal antichains of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>; both order relations are explicit parameters.</li>\n<li>All numbered aliases now denote this single notion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-maximal-antichain","status":"resolved","id":"fb7c32a0f0383968","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-maximal-antichain]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3",